      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Philip%20Williams\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Philip Williams</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President, Chief Executive Officer and Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Williams has over 20 years of experience in the mining and finance industries. He was previously the CEO of Consolidated Uranium Inc. before its merger with IsoEnergy. He has held various roles in equity research and investment banking.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Graham%20Long\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Graham Long</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Long is a finance professional with experience in the mining sector, previously serving as CFO of Consolidated Uranium Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Darryl%20Clark\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Darryl Clark</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Vice President, Exploration and Strategy</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Dr. Clark is an exploration geologist with over 25 years of experience in the mining industry, including senior roles at Cameco and Rio Tinto.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Peter%20Netupsky\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Peter Netupsky</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2024</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Vice President, Corporate Development</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Netupsky has over 15 years of experience in corporate development and investment banking, previously with Agnico Eagle Mines.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Marty%20Tunney\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Marty Tunney</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Operating Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Tunney is a mining engineer with over 20 years of experience in the resource sector, including roles at Newmont and CIBC.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Peter%20Hawley\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Peter Hawley</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Hawley is a geologist with over 35 years of experience in the mining industry and is the founder of Sabina Gold & Silver Corp.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Richard%20Murphy\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Richard Murphy</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman and Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Murphy is a geologist with over 30 years of experience in the mining industry. He is currently the President and CEO of Argonaut Gold.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Richard%20Murphy\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Richard Murphy</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman and Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Murphy is a geologist with over 30 years of experience in the mining industry. He is currently the President and CEO of Argonaut Gold.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Philip%20Williams\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Philip Williams</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Williams is the President and CEO of IsoEnergy and former CEO of Consolidated Uranium.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Leigh%20Curyer\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Leigh Curyer</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Curyer is the founder, President, and CEO of NexGen Energy Ltd. He has over 20 years of experience in the resources sector.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Christopher%20McFadden\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Christopher McFadden</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. McFadden is a lawyer with over 20 years of experience in the mining industry, currently serving as Chairman of NexGen Energy.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Peter%20Hawley\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Peter Hawley</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Hawley is a geologist with over 35 years of experience in the mining industry and is the founder of Sabina Gold & Silver Corp.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.isoenergy.ca/about/management/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">IsoEnergy Official Website - Management Team Page</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-22)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.isoenergy.ca/about/board-of-directors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">IsoEnergy Official Website - Board of Directors Page</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-22)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sedarplus.ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Management Information Circular dated April 26, 2024</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-04-26)</span></li></ul>"
